{
    "word": "pizzazz",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "4cdcc751-5858-3df9-9d53-5653f4d0bd22",
                "word": "pizzazz",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ea6b4a08-4008-3968-bbb9-3a2cedb62512",
                        "entry_id": "4cdcc751-5858-3df9-9d53-5653f4d0bd22",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Flair, vitality, or zest; energy; vigor."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0124993b-ae9a-4919-b583-c1db94826a88",
                                "sense_id": "ea6b4a08-4008-3968-bbb9-3a2cedb62512",
                                "text": "The show had a lot of pizzazz, with glittering costumes and upbeat music."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d81d13a8-7f25-40e7-b302-d47911384e26",
                                "sense_id": "ea6b4a08-4008-3968-bbb9-3a2cedb62512",
                                "text": "Pizazz, to quote the editor of the Harvard Lampoon, is an indefinable dynamic quality, the je ne sais quoi of function; as, for instance, adding Scotch puts the pizazz into a drink. Certain clothes have it, too. 1. There's pizazz in this rust evening coat, swinging wide in back, jutting crazily over the shoulders, clasped with a cord at the throat."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5007397a-c4e2-4884-856a-b8f5a2b6bd57",
                                "sense_id": "ea6b4a08-4008-3968-bbb9-3a2cedb62512",
                                "text": "[Rahiem] Classified as a lover with a certain pizzazz / And you might even call it razzamatazz"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b7216522-5e89-4154-899c-38f064cbd8e0",
                                "sense_id": "ea6b4a08-4008-3968-bbb9-3a2cedb62512",
                                "text": "Who says a beer can't be exciting, folks. Let me tell you something, folks, this here little can has got more oomph! More pazazz! More body than Mae West any day!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5b8d22c2-67d7-4dd5-9b52-de03781def6c",
                                "sense_id": "ea6b4a08-4008-3968-bbb9-3a2cedb62512",
                                "text": "With his miner's helmet in one hand, a white towel in the other, [Mario] Sepúlveda began to dance. He spun with the gusto and pzazz of a huaso, a Chilean cowboy."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c5d3d73f-3bd8-4f2b-a2f1-1173edcbe1a5",
                                "sense_id": "ea6b4a08-4008-3968-bbb9-3a2cedb62512",
                                "text": "Driven by legalized gambling, many of the [Las Vegas] strip's motels had morphed into giant hotels with gambling floors and night clubs and surrounded by large parking lots. Closeness to Hollywood (with its fantasy world of entertainment bizazz) influenced strip architecture."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1b0c9e6a-7eac-44f5-83d8-e96fe1feab7d",
                                "sense_id": "ea6b4a08-4008-3968-bbb9-3a2cedb62512",
                                "text": "Nah brov … nah brov … you see ultimately … without reason … without technique … without – pazzazz … one is sure to get, left behind …"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9ad780b7-857c-4f57-9d6e-f28a24909867",
                                "sense_id": "ea6b4a08-4008-3968-bbb9-3a2cedb62512",
                                "text": "I don't think bezazz was the particular specialty of my mother … That's right cement and gravel, Chicago. Nice girl I'm told … but more in the line of barns than bezazz. Of course I never really knew her."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "72e83a8f-faec-49b6-b89f-104af83654a4",
                                "sense_id": "ea6b4a08-4008-3968-bbb9-3a2cedb62512",
                                "text": "As they prepare for Sunday's telling match with Newcastle, Southampton are 12th in the table and their new manager, Mauricio Pellegrino, has introduced such pizzazz that they have mustered five goals in seven league matches."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1534baaa-5e95-46e9-ad98-7f0c23a8c7af",
                        "source_entry_id": "4cdcc751-5858-3df9-9d53-5653f4d0bd22",
                        "source_sense_id": "ea6b4a08-4008-3968-bbb9-3a2cedb62512",
                        "source_sense_description": "flair, vitality, or zest",
                        "target_lang_word": "peps",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "peps",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8a76f7c6-826e-3bf6-81b9-9876cdcf7014",
                                        "entry_id": "20adea2e-2bc6-38bd-b165-18f75ca5e13d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Énergie, entrain, vigueur, dynamisme, punch, tonus."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4ba88413-1354-4be6-960a-e561eeb28ce4",
                                                "sense_id": "8a76f7c6-826e-3bf6-81b9-9876cdcf7014",
                                                "text": "Avoir du peps."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2d934658-765c-4e17-8416-d5cdd268cf2a",
                                                "sense_id": "8a76f7c6-826e-3bf6-81b9-9876cdcf7014",
                                                "text": "Comment redonner du peps à votre relation."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "88637abb-ea2a-40c5-af7e-9e99ea2c2f48",
                                                "sense_id": "8a76f7c6-826e-3bf6-81b9-9876cdcf7014",
                                                "text": "Puis herbivore c’est pas rentable, on voit bien qu’il faut manger toute la journée pour avoir un peu de peps le soir, et encore, c’est gâché par la digestion."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "07315f8c-67a2-4cd6-b7c7-119c2bfc1760",
                                                "sense_id": "8a76f7c6-826e-3bf6-81b9-9876cdcf7014",
                                                "text": "Ce film était intéressant mais il manquait un peu de peps."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "192b08da-4165-4c86-9973-4ed16d3aa68e",
                                                "sense_id": "8a76f7c6-826e-3bf6-81b9-9876cdcf7014",
                                                "text": "Ton discours était bien mais ça manquait de peps pour captiver le public."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8723c7a9-b3fc-48ea-b907-817c0c4cca37",
                                                "sense_id": "8a76f7c6-826e-3bf6-81b9-9876cdcf7014",
                                                "text": "Ces décorations sont jolies mais ça manque de peps pour une fête d'anniversaire."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "903ed06d-a8ec-4c47-91b5-fb16fba957b7",
                                                "sense_id": "8a76f7c6-826e-3bf6-81b9-9876cdcf7014",
                                                "text": "La réunion était trop longue et sans peps, tout le monde s'ennuyait."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "word_linkages": []
            }
        ],
